; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR MORSE SENDER v17  -  type it, it goes out on Q   (loads at $4000, VM1)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot. Choose a speed (5-25 words per minute, Enter = 12), then type
; a line and press Enter: it is sent as Morse on the Q line - and so on anything
; wired to Q - with each character on the hex display and on the terminal with
; its dots and dashes. Enter on an empty line quits. Replaces Morse Code V16
; (its dots had a zero delay). Correct timing: dash 3 dots; gaps 1 / 3 / 7.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/morse_tx_verify.py, V0061.34): its Q line recorded and decoded back BY TIMING RATIOS ALONE: 'CQ DE STELLAR 73' at 12 WPM, 'HELLO, WORLD? (1802)/@=+' at 25, SOS at 5 - all exact; dash = 3 dots and gaps 1/3/7 within 12%%; the dot within 2%% of 1200/WPM ms (100.4 ms at 12 WPM, 48.9 at 25, 243 at 5); the hex display and terminal show each character; bad speeds are asked again, Enter alone = 12; a rerun without reloading sends correctly.
; HW-VERIFIED on the Elf2K (V0061.34), 2026-09-25: sends correctly.
;
; 163 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000
; D 4009 0A 00          SETQ 00                            Q off to start
; D 400B 11 0E 06 00    LOADXI R14 0600
; D 400F C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; ASK:
; D 4011 11 0E 06 A0    LOADXI R14 06A0
; D 4015 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4017 11 0C 0A 00    LOADXI R12 0A00
; D 401B 11 0D 0A 00    LOADXI R13 0A00
; D 401F C2 CD          GETSTR R12 R13                     the number
; D 4021 11 05 00 00    LOADXI R5 0000
; D 4025 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; DIG:
; D 4029 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00                    next character
; D 402D 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 402F 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 4031 A0 00 56       IFTRUEI DGD
; D 4034 11 09 00 30    LOADXI R9 0030
; D 4038 89 79          TESTLXY R7 < R9
; D 403A A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK                        not a digit: ask again
; D 403D 11 09 00 3A    LOADXI R9 003A
; D 4041 88 79          TESTGXY R7 >= R9
; D 4043 A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4046 53 07 00 30    SUBXI R7 0030
; D 404A 4A 5F          MULTXY R5 * R15
; D 404C 21 15          COPYAX MA -> R5                    W x 10
; D 404E 50 57 05       ADDXYZ R5 + R7 -> R5               + the digit
; D 4051 42 01          INCX R1
; D 4053 B0 00 29       GAL DIG
; DGD:
; D 4056 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 4058 A1 00 5F       IFFALSEI HAVE
; D 405B 11 05 00 0C    LOADXI R5 000C                     Enter alone: 12
; HAVE:
; D 405F 11 09 00 05    LOADXI R9 0005
; D 4063 89 59          TESTLXY R5 < R9
; D 4065 A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4068 11 09 00 1A    LOADXI R9 001A
; D 406C 88 59          TESTGXY R5 >= R9
; D 406E A0 00 11       IFTRUEI ASK
; D 4071 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 4074 11 0A 00 02    LOADXI R10 0002
; D 4078 4D 9A          DIVXY R9 / R10
; D 407A 25             COPYMAA
; D 407B 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 407D 52 09 01 2F    ADDXI R9 012F
; D 4081 4D 95          DIVXY R9 / R5
; D 4083 25             COPYMAA
; D 4084 21 06          COPYAX Acc -> R6                   R6 = ticks per dot
; D 4086 11 0E 06 D1    LOADXI R14 06D1
; D 408A C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 408C 23 00 54       COPYXY R5 -> R4
; D 408F BD 01 A1       CALL PRNUM
; D 4092 11 0E 06 DF    LOADXI R14 06DF
; D 4096 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; LINE:
; D 4098 11 0E 06 F4    LOADXI R14 06F4
; D 409C C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 409E 11 0C 0A 00    LOADXI R12 0A00
; D 40A2 11 0D 0A 00    LOADXI R13 0A00
; D 40A6 C2 CD          GETSTR R12 R13                     what to send
; D 40A8 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 40AC 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00
; D 40B0 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 40B2 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 40B4 A0 01 85       IFTRUEI QUIT                       empty: quit
; D 40B7 11 0E 06 FD    LOADXI R14 06FD
; D 40BB C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; CH:
; D 40BD 2E 01 0A 00    READIDX R1 0A00
; D 40C1 21 03          COPYAX Acc -> R3
; D 40C3 8C 03          TESTXZ R3
; D 40C5 A0 01 82       IFTRUEI EOL
; D 40C8 11 09 00 61    LOADXI R9 0061
; D 40CC 89 39          TESTLXY R3 < R9
; D 40CE A0 00 DE       IFTRUEI UP
; D 40D1 11 09 00 7B    LOADXI R9 007B
; D 40D5 88 39          TESTGXY R3 >= R9
; D 40D7 A0 00 DE       IFTRUEI UP
; D 40DA 53 03 00 20    SUBXI R3 0020                      lower case -> upper
; UP:
; D 40DE 86 03 00 20    TESTXI R3 0020
; D 40E2 A1 00 FC       IFFALSEI NSP
; D 40E5 CA 20          SEROUTI 20                         a space: the word gap
; D 40E7 CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 40E9 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 40EC 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4
; D 40EF 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4               4 units - plus the 3 after the letter = 7
; D 40F2 53 04 00 04    SUBXI R4 0004                      less the fixed work around it
; D 40F6 BD 01 91       CALL WAIT
; D 40F9 B0 01 7D       GAL NXT
; NSP:
; D 40FC 11 09 00 20    LOADXI R9 0020
; D 4100 89 39          TESTLXY R3 < R9
; D 4102 A0 01 7D       IFTRUEI NXT                        control characters: skip
; D 4105 11 09 00 60    LOADXI R9 0060
; D 4109 88 39          TESTGXY R3 >= R9
; D 410B A0 01 7D       IFTRUEI NXT
; D 410E 23 00 32       COPYXY R3 -> R2
; D 4111 53 02 00 20    SUBXI R2 0020
; D 4115 11 09 00 08    LOADXI R9 0008
; D 4119 4A 29          MULTXY R2 * R9
; D 411B 21 12          COPYAX MA -> R2                    slot = (char - $20) x 8
; D 411D 2E 02 0C 00    READIDX R2 0C00
; D 4121 81 00 00       TESTAI 0000
; D 4124 A0 01 7D       IFTRUEI NXT                        no Morse for it: skip
; D 4127 22 03          COPYXA R3 -> Acc
; D 4129 05 00          OUTA 00                            the character on the hex display
; D 412B 22 03          COPYXA R3 -> Acc
; D 412D C9             SEROUT                             and on the terminal
; D 412E CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; EL:
; D 4130 2E 02 0C 00    READIDX R2 0C00                    the next element
; D 4134 21 07          COPYAX Acc -> R7
; D 4136 8C 07          TESTXZ R7
; D 4138 A0 01 6C       IFTRUEI EOC
; D 413B 22 07          COPYXA R7 -> Acc
; D 413D C9             SEROUT                             '.' or '-' on the terminal
; D 413E 0A 01          SETQ 01                            key down
; D 4140 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 4143 86 07 00 2D    TESTXI R7 002D
; D 4147 A1 01 54       IFFALSEI DOT
; D 414A 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4
; D 414D 50 46 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R6 -> R4               a dash: 3 units
; D 4150 53 04 00 01    SUBXI R4 0001
; DOT:
; D 4154 53 04 00 01    SUBXI R4 0001                      less the fixed work around it
; D 4158 BD 01 91       CALL WAIT
; D 415B 0A 00          SETQ 00                            key up
; D 415D 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 4160 53 04 00 02    SUBXI R4 0002
; D 4164 BD 01 91       CALL WAIT                          the 1-unit gap after every element
; D 4167 42 02          INCX R2
; D 4169 B0 01 30       GAL EL
; EOC:
; D 416C CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 416E CA 20          SEROUTI 20
; D 4170 23 00 64       COPYXY R6 -> R4
; D 4173 50 44 04       ADDXYZ R4 + R4 -> R4               2 more units: 3 between letters
; D 4176 53 04 00 08    SUBXI R4 0008
; D 417A BD 01 91       CALL WAIT
; NXT:
; D 417D 42 01          INCX R1
; D 417F B0 00 BD       GAL CH
; EOL:
; D 4182 B0 00 98       GAL LINE
; QUIT:
; D 4185 11 0E 07 00    LOADXI R14 0700
; D 4189 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 418B 0A 00          SETQ 00
; D 418D 00             HALT
; D 418E F0 00 00       BREAK
; WAIT:
; D 4191 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 4193 A0 01 9F       IFTRUEI WX
; WL:
; D 4196 C0 01          DLYI 01
; D 4198 43 04          DECX R4
; D 419A 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 419C A1 01 96       IFFALSEI WL
; WX:
; D 419F BE 00          RETURN
; PRNUM:
; D 41A1 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; PN1:
; D 41A5 4D 4F          DIVXY R4 / R15
; D 41A7 27             COPYREMA
; D 41A8 70 00          PUSHA Acc                          digits onto the stack
; D 41AA 42 08          INCX R8
; D 41AC 25             COPYMAA
; D 41AD 21 04          COPYAX Acc -> R4
; D 41AF 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 41B1 A1 01 A5       IFFALSEI PN1
; PN2:
; D 41B4 71 00          POPA Acc
; D 41B6 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41B9 C9             SEROUT
; D 41BA 43 08          DECX R8
; D 41BC 8C 08          TESTXZ R8
; D 41BE A1 01 B4       IFFALSEI PN2
; D 41C1 BE 00          RETURN

